独立核验相关引用。","source",{"_225":242,"_243":244,"_245":246,"_247":239,"_248":249},"publishedAt","publishedPrecision","calendar","calendarDate","2026-10-18","originalUrl","https://www.amz123.com/t/3A7Hd9L5","selected",false,"factId","faOr9ZpRNask","publisher-amz123-headlines","name","AMZ123 · 跨境头条","kind","web_list","firstParty","iconUrl","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/0083c7bf2225c6c0.webp","i2nhxekk7mc2gi2uk3sac0d3y","美国CBP加强IOR信息核查，卖家需自查进口商登记资料","美国海关与边境保护局（CBP）加强对进口商记录（IOR）的核查，若CBP Form 5106中的信息不准确或不完整，相关IOR编号可能被作废。作者建议通过美国公司经营亚马逊或使用第三方物流的卖家尽快开展自查，重点核实实体地址、联系邮箱、联系电话及报关授权是否真实有效且属于IOR本身。",{"_225":257,"_243":258,"_245":246,"_247":239,"_248":259},"timestamp","https://www.cifnews.com/article/189596",true,"publisher-cifnews-amazon","雨果跨境 · 亚马逊频道最新","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/3eb2ff60f5bc21ce.webp",{"_240":241,"_11":261,"_262":-5,"_18":19,"_15":16,"_263":264},"美国海关强化Form 5106核查致IOR风险","occurredAt","representative",{"_225":250,"_11":251,"_26":252,"_229":265,"_231":21,"_232":254,"_234":-5,"_236":255,"_238":256,"_240":241},{"_225":257,"_243":258,"_245":246,"_247":239,"_248":259},"participants48h",0,"newParticipants6h","recentReports24h","observationComplete","rank",{"_273":274},"changelogVersion","2026-10-09T22:08"]
